Formgen: Forms can now send the user back to an external application after submitting. If the form is opened with the URL parameter "returnUrl", the load response contains "formSettings" with "returnUrlEnabled": true and the host of the URL is one of "returnUrlDomains" (exact match, http or https only), the user is redirected to this URL after submitting instead of seeing the success screen. The returnUrl takes precedence over the successUrl. This only applies to the web version.
